@startuml menu-flow
' SPEC: _spec/apps/starchess/menu-flow.puml
' purpose: Menu → Single Player / Tutorial; gameOver → result modal → rematch|/review/:id.
!include ../../themes/proveo.puml

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

title StarChess · Menu → Single Player / Tutorial / Review replay

actor Player

package "apps/starchess" {
  component "StarChessMenuRoute\n/ (Router base /starchess)" as MENU <<app>>
  component "StarChessMenuScreen\n+ MenuSky / MenuArrival" as UI <<app>>
  component "ChessMenuMockup\nglass · shatter SVGs" as MOCK <<async>>
  component "NewGamePanel\nMAP · TEAM · Adjutant(Script) · START" as SETUP <<app>>
  component "navigate /single?map=&team=" as NAV <<async>>
  component "navigate /tutorial" as NAVT <<async>>
  component "navigate /review" as NAVR <<async>>
  component "StarChessSingleScreen\nMatchStore + LiveMatchShell\nStarChessScreen turnChrome=sidebar\nAdjutant = opposite of team" as LIVE <<app>>
  component "StarChessTutorialScreen\n/tutorial/:section/:story\n(TUTORIAL_SCRIPT ids)\nKerrigan header · HOME-only\ne.g. /tutorial/fog/king" as TUT <<app>>
  component "TutorialCompleteConfirm\nking-hunt-live enemy HP=0\nwhen tutorialCleared=false" as TUTDONE <<app>>
  component "localStorage\nstarchess_tutorial_cleared" as TUTFLAG <<db>>
  component "ExitGameConfirm\nHome during planning/targeting/resolving" as EXIT <<error>>
  component "gameOver → matchHistory\nMatchResultModal\nVICTORY|DEFEAT (+DRAW)" as END <<db>>
  component "MatchResultModal\nAnother Game · Replay" as RESULT <<app>>
  component "StarChessReviewScreen\n/review list · /review/:id DualNav" as REV <<app>>
}

Player ARROW_MAIN MENU
MENU ARROW_MAIN UI
UI ARROW_OPTIONAL MOCK : from /chess/\n(session flag)
MOCK ARROW_MAIN UI : glass · Kerrigan\n· shatter · chrome in
UI ARROW_MAIN SETUP : Single Player
SETUP ARROW_MAIN NAV : START
NAV ARROW_MAIN LIVE
UI ARROW_MAIN NAVT : Tutorial
NAVT ARROW_MAIN TUT
UI ARROW_MAIN NAVR : Review
NAVR ARROW_MAIN REV
LIVE ARROW_ERROR EXIT : Home
EXIT ARROW_OPTIONAL MENU : Leave confirmed
TUT ARROW_OPTIONAL MENU : Home
TUT ARROW_MAIN TUTDONE : king-hunt-live win\n+ uncleared
TUTDONE ARROW_MAIN TUTFLAG : Go Home → cleared=true
TUTDONE ARROW_MAIN MENU : Go Home
LIVE ARROW_MAIN END : gameOver
END ARROW_MAIN RESULT : save + open modal
RESULT ARROW_MAIN LIVE : Another Game\n(same map+team rematch)
RESULT ARROW_MAIN REV : Replay\nreplace /review/:id

note bottom
  Multiplayer **MenuAnchor** stays ``disabled`` + ``Coming Soon``.
  Live gameOver → ``matchHistory`` + ``MatchResultModal``
  (``VICTORY`` / ``DEFEAT`` / ``DRAW``): **Another Game** remounts
  ``/single?map=&team=``; **Replay** → ``/review/:id`` DualNav.
  Review list remains at ``/review``: ``MatchHistoryFilters``
  (Playing as Blue/Red + date pages; no First move; no Review title) via
  ``useMatchHistoryFilters`` · ``‹ Back`` only. On the dynamic band a
  ``MobileBanner`` (``href="/"``) owns that chrome — ``‹ Back`` + ``compact``
  filters (swatches + date pager, no caption); the in-flow inset stands down
  because its min-content height collides with the list. See ``screens.puml``.
  Review detail ``/review/:id``: Coach-style title stack
  (``Win (Blue)`` · ``Alex (Blue) vs Adjutant (Red)``) above ``ReviewTurnNav``.
  Coach ``/chess/`` → ``/starchess/`` (nerd yes / ``StarChessRedirect``)
  sets ``starchess_from_chess``; menu plays ``MenuArrival``:
  Chess mockup (Coach light/dark tokens via ``data-theme``) → glass clears
  to sky → Selena→Kerrigan → buttons shatter → StarChess anchors fade in.
  Storybook: Screens/Menu · StarChess toggle · Theme toolbar.
  Tutorial → ``/tutorial/:section/:story`` (ids from ``TUTORIAL_SCRIPT``,
  e.g. ``/tutorial/fog/king`` · ``/tutorial/specials/marine``).
  Bare ``/tutorial`` canonicalizes to the first Fog story.
  **Lesson loop — objective → success → next.** The goal shows persistently in
  the footer (``board.objective``, else the story comment) so coach reactions
  never bury it. ``completeWhen`` / ``restartWhen`` are judged **only on a
  settled board** (timeline idle): success flips the guide bubble to its
  success variant (``✓ Objective complete`` + ``Next lesson →``) and
  auto-advances after 1.5s; the CTA skips the wait. Failure offers Retry.
  Every live lesson must carry a ``completeWhen`` — a lesson without one is a
  dead end (guarded by ``tutorialLessons.test.tsx``).
  **Stage 3 (Turn Resolution)** wears ``/review/:id`` chrome: ``‹ Back`` +
  ``ReviewTurnNav`` arrows above the board, turn/phase in the rail
  (``hideDualNav``). The arrows step one **phase** (Check → Intent → Resolve)
  rather than a whole turn — ``playReviewTurn`` plays a turn straight through,
  so the lesson is the slow-motion version of the Review screen it introduces.
  The bespoke ``TutorialTypewriterNav`` transcript is gone; the phase readout
  between the arrows replaces it.
  ``starchess_tutorial_cleared`` (default false): King Hunt (live) enemy
  HP=0 opens ``TutorialCompleteConfirm`` when still false —
  Go Home sets cleared=true and returns to menu.
  Deployment / PWA: ``deployment.puml``. HUD: ``screens.puml``.
  Leave chrome: ``ScreenBackNav`` + ``ChevronNav`` (+ ``PanelTitle`` where
  labeled) on tutorial / live ``/single`` (top panel · ``‹ Back``).
end note
@enduml
